      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The plasma levels of thromboxane B2 (TxB2) were determined by radioimmunoassay in 6 consecutive patients with Prinzmetal's angina and in 9 healthy volunteers. In the normal group TxB2 was not detectable (= 0.5 pmoles/ml), while in patients with variant angina TxB2 was consistently detected (1.5-140 pmole/ml)."},
